    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_AlloySolder_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "An Alloy Solder from before Water-Driven Infrastructure switched to the shared Tin Solder of CSFFModFramework. Within a quarter of an hour it becomes Tin Solder by itself; Reforge as Tin Solder does it at once. Nothing makes this card any more."
  },
